Urkel-nomically correct.
厄克尔经济学上正确。

442
00:20:35.010 --> 00:20:35.490
Improversation.
即兴交谈。

443
00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:36.470
Profil-a-gate.
亵渎。

444
00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:37.650
It's a little hypercritical.
这有点虚伪。

445
