How the turntables.
风水轮流转。

446
00:20:40.490 --> 00:20:42.270
I am not to be truffled with.
我可不是好惹的。

447
00:20:42.430 --> 00:20:43.790
Gotta keep yourself dehydrated.
得让自己保持脱水状态。

448
00:20:44.030 --> 00:20:44.990
She's an anorexetic.
她是个厌食症患者。

449
00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:47.450
You're going to H-E-L-L double hockey sticks.
