1384
01:05:17.360 --> 01:05:19.060
That's in branch closing.
那是《分部关闭》那一集里的。

1385
01:05:19.660 --> 01:05:23.980
And number five is about Michael Scott's suits.
第五题是关于迈克尔·斯科特的西装的。

1386
01:05:24.520 --> 01:05:25.080
Okay?
好吗？

1387
01:05:26.420 --> 01:05:27.380
Mysterious?
很神秘吗？

1388
01:05:28.000 --> 01:05:28.600
Yeah.
是啊。

1389
01:05:29.160 --> 01:05:29.440
No.
不对。

1390
01:05:29.780 --> 01:05:30.900
Am I jumping ahead?
我是不是跳得太快了？

1391
01:05:32.320 --> 01:05:38.160
I found the actual suit that Steve wore because it's being auctioned off.
我找到了史蒂夫穿过的那套西装，因为它正在拍卖。

1392
01:05:38.280 --> 01:05:40.140
And so I found out who makes it.
所以我查到了是谁做的。

1393
01:05:40.640 --> 01:05:40.940
Okay.
好吧。

1394
01:05:42.020 --> 01:05:43.400
But how would we know?
但我们怎么可能知道呢？

1395
01:05:43.540 --> 01:05:44.820
You guys aren't going to know that.
你们肯定不知道。

1396
01:05:44.980 --> 01:05:45.680
Of course not.
当然不知道。

1397
01:05:46.360 --> 01:05:46.960
Maybe I'll just change.
也许我该换个话题。

1398
01:05:46.960 --> 01:05:47.740
Tommy Hilfiger.
汤米·希尔费格。

1399
01:05:48.060 --> 01:05:48.900
Men's Warehouse.
男士仓库。

1400
01:05:49.960 --> 01:05:51.080
Stafford Essentials.
斯塔福德精选。

1401
01:05:51.220 --> 01:05:51.560
Oh!
噢！

1402
01:05:51.560 --> 01:05:53.140
Doesn't that sound fancy?
听起来是不是很高级？

1403
01:05:53.320 --> 01:05:54.040
That sounds right.
听起来确实如此。

1404
01:05:54.340 --> 01:05:55.880
Navy blue polyester wool.
藏青色涤纶羊毛混纺。

1405
01:05:56.420 --> 01:05:57.520
There you have it.
就是这样。

1406
01:05:57.640 --> 01:05:59.120
That's who makes Michael's suits.
迈克尔的西装就是那家做的。

1407
01:05:59.700 --> 01:06:00.740
That's my quiz.
那是我的测验。

1408
01:06:01.200 --> 01:06:02.680
That was the worst quiz I've ever been to.
那是我参加过最烂的测验。

1409
01:06:02.680 --> 01:06:03.760
I'm so sorry.
真抱歉。

1410
01:06:04.100 --> 01:06:05.160
Sam, you won.
萨姆，你赢了。

1411
01:06:05.380 --> 01:06:05.580
Yeah.
耶。

1412
01:06:05.880 --> 01:06:07.960
Sam, you were the clear winner.
萨姆，你是当之无愧的赢家。

1413
01:06:08.380 --> 01:06:10.660
There's an entire bowl of untouched.
还有整整一碗没动过的。

1414
01:06:10.780 --> 01:06:11.020
No.
不。

1415
01:06:11.140 --> 01:06:15.800
You win a can of black olives that's in the fridge and a jar of mayonnaise.
你赢得了一罐冰箱里的黑橄榄和一罐蛋黄酱。

1416
01:06:16.140 --> 01:06:18.060
I don't recommend mixing them.
我不建议把它们混在一起吃。

1417
01:06:18.100 --> 01:06:18.500
Let's party.
让我们狂欢吧。

1418
01:06:18.660 --> 01:06:20.540
But maybe on their own they'll be okay.
但也许单独吃还行。

1419
01:06:21.660 --> 01:06:24.600
Well, I think that's a pretty great way to end this episode.
嗯，我觉得这是结束本集非常棒的方式。

1420
01:06:24.600 --> 01:06:27.840
I would like to share this final thought before we go.
在结束之前，我想分享最后一点感想。

1421
01:06:28.060 --> 01:06:34.520
It is an amazing Michael Scott haiku from Cat M in North Carolina.
这是一首来自北卡罗来纳州Cat M写的精彩迈克尔·斯科特俳句。

1422
01:06:35.040 --> 01:06:36.060
Are you ready?
准备好了吗？

1423
01:06:36.520 --> 01:06:36.840
Yes.
准备好了。

1424
01:06:37.060 --> 01:06:39.100
I mean, a Michael Scott haiku.
我是说，一首迈克尔·斯科特俳句。

1425
01:06:39.320 --> 01:06:39.780
Come on.
来吧。

1426
01:06:40.720 --> 01:06:44.160
A boss with no tact who just wanted a family.
一个毫无分寸却只想拥有家人的老板。

1427
01:06:44.760 --> 01:06:46.460
We cried when he left.
他离开时我们都哭了。

1428
01:06:47.420 --> 01:06:47.940
Aw.
啊。

1429
01:06:48.440 --> 01:06:49.660
Kind of sums it up.
总结得挺到位。

1430
01:06:49.780 --> 01:06:50.480
Really does.
确实如此。

1431
01:06:50.480 --> 01:06:56.760
Well, in doing research for this episode, there was just so much fun stuff online about Michael Scott.
嗯，在为这一集做调研时，网上关于迈克尔·斯科特的有趣内容实在太多了。

1432
01:06:57.020 --> 01:07:04.120
In addition to all of the episodes we have and shooting drafts and candy bag alts, I love this character.
除了我们拥有的所有剧集、拍摄草稿和糖果袋备选台词，我真的很喜欢这个角色。

1433
01:07:04.380 --> 01:07:05.400
He's just amazing.
他真是太棒了。

1434
01:07:05.400 --> 01:07:08.040
But I wanted to share one fun thing I stumbled across.
但我还是想分享一个我偶然发现的有趣东西。

1435
01:07:08.040 --> 01:07:12.200
It's a really great article if you love all the props on Michael's desk.
如果你喜欢迈克尔桌上的所有道具，那这篇文章真的很棒。

1436
01:07:12.440 --> 01:07:16.860
It is titled, The Ultimate Guide to Michael Scott's Desk Toy Collection.
标题是《迈克尔·斯科特桌面玩具收藏终极指南》。

1437
01:07:17.040 --> 01:07:21.560
It lists all the toys on Michael's desk and gives you a link where you can buy them.
它列出了迈克尔桌上所有的玩具，并提供了购买链接。

1438
01:07:21.800 --> 01:07:22.160
Oh.
噢。

1439
01:07:22.160 --> 01:07:28.020
So if you want to recreate your very own Michael Scott desk, I will put that link in stories to the article.
所以如果你想重现属于你自己的迈克尔·斯科特办公桌，我会把那篇文章的链接放在快拍里。

1440
01:07:28.440 --> 01:07:32.180
Well, I feel like we could do six episodes on Michael Scott.
嗯，我觉得我们可以为迈克尔·斯科特做六集节目。

1441
01:07:32.860 --> 01:07:35.100
There's so much we didn't even talk about.
还有很多我们甚至都没谈到。

1442
01:07:35.240 --> 01:07:35.520
I know.
我知道。

1443
01:07:35.660 --> 01:07:38.840
But I do think we uncovered some really fun new stuff about his character.
但我确实认为我们挖掘出了一些关于他角色的非常有趣的新东西。

1444
01:07:38.840 --> 01:07:40.120
I really enjoyed this.
我真的很享受这次讨论。

1445
01:07:40.120 --> 01:07:43.100
I did, too, and I'm excited to do this for other characters.
我也是，我很期待为其他角色也做这样的节目。

1446
01:07:43.800 --> 01:07:44.100
Yeah.
是啊。

1447
01:07:44.380 --> 01:07:44.980
Let us know.
告诉我们吧。

1448
01:07:45.120 --> 01:07:46.080
Who should we do next?
下一个该做谁呢？

1449
01:07:46.100 --> 01:07:49.020
We do not have to go, like, in any particular order, right?
我们不需要按任何特定的顺序来，对吧？

1450
01:07:49.480 --> 01:07:50.100
No, we don't.
不需要。

1451
01:07:50.220 --> 01:07:51.560
We just do whoever we feel like.
我们只是随心所欲地选择采访对象。

1452
01:07:51.660 --> 01:07:52.620
That's what she said.
她也是这么说的。

1453
01:07:52.620 --> 01:08:02.160
A big thank you to Steve Carell, Greg Daniels, Gene Stupnitsky, Lee Eisenberg, and Rob Burnett for helping us get all the dish on Michael Scott.
非常感谢史蒂夫·卡瑞尔、格雷格·丹尼尔斯、吉恩·斯图普尼茨基、李·艾森伯格和罗伯·伯内特，感谢你们帮我们挖掘了关于迈克尔·斯科特的所有内幕。

1454
01:08:02.440 --> 01:08:04.980
And thank you to Allison Jones for answering our question.
还要感谢艾莉森·琼斯回答了我们的问题。

1455
01:08:05.280 --> 01:08:09.400
And to Michael Scott Souza for sharing with us about having the same name as Michael.
感谢迈克尔·斯科特·索萨与我们分享他与迈克尔同名的经历。

1456
01:08:09.640 --> 01:08:16.620
And really, just a huge thank you for everyone who wrote in questions about Michael Scott, their observations about this character.
真的，非常感谢每一位写信询问迈克尔·斯科特相关问题，以及分享对这个角色看法的朋友们。

1457
01:08:16.840 --> 01:08:18.640
You really helped us make this episode.
你们真的帮了我们大忙，让我们完成了这一集。

1458
01:08:18.760 --> 01:08:19.720
We love you so much.
我们非常爱你们。

1459
01:08:19.720 --> 01:08:26.960
And before we go, I just wanted to say thank you to people who have shared with me that they're going to watch my Hallmark Christmas movie, you guys.
在结束之前，我只想对那些告诉我他们会去看我主演的Hallmark圣诞电影的朋友们说声谢谢。

1460
01:08:27.080 --> 01:08:27.720
This weekend.
就在这个周末。

1461
01:08:27.800 --> 01:08:29.160
Yes, it's this Sunday.
没错，就在这周日。

1462
01:08:29.480 --> 01:08:30.740
It's Sunday evening.
周日晚上。

1463
01:08:31.040 --> 01:08:32.220
Check your local listings.
请查看当地节目表。

1464
01:08:32.420 --> 01:08:33.480
I think it's either 7 p.m.
我想应该是晚上7点。

1465
01:08:33.520 --> 01:08:35.140
or 8 p.m., depending on where you are.
或者8点，取决于你所在的地区。

1466
01:08:35.320 --> 01:08:37.940
It is called Confessions of a Christmas Letter.
电影名字叫《圣诞信件的告白》。

1467
01:08:38.740 --> 01:08:41.460
Brian Baumgartner has a fun, fun cameo in it.
布莱恩·鲍姆加特纳在里面有一个非常非常有趣的客串。

1468
01:08:41.520 --> 01:08:42.940
It was so great to work with him again.
能再次与他合作真是太棒了。

1469
01:08:43.060 --> 01:08:45.980
And it's just a really sweet Christmas movie.
这真的是一部非常温馨的圣诞电影。

1470
01:08:46.280 --> 01:08:48.320
If you watch it, will you tag me?
如果你看了，能标记我一下吗？

1471
01:08:48.320 --> 01:08:50.960
I want to share if you get together with friends and family.
如果你和亲朋好友聚在一起看，我想分享一下。

1472
01:08:51.120 --> 01:08:52.660
We're going to get together and watch it.
我们打算聚在一起看这部电影。

1473
01:08:52.740 --> 01:08:53.480
I can't wait.
我等不及了。

1474
01:08:53.700 --> 01:08:55.140
Yeah, we're having a viewing party.
是啊，我们要举办一个观影派对。

1475
01:08:55.300 --> 01:08:57.920
And it's going to be just super fun.
一定会超级有趣的。

1476
01:08:58.200 --> 01:08:59.080
So thank you, guys.
所以，谢谢大家。

1477
01:08:59.480 --> 01:09:01.220
And yeah, I'm excited.
没错，我很兴奋。

1478
01:09:01.800 --> 01:09:02.100
All right.
好的。

1479
01:09:02.160 --> 01:09:06.240
Well, we will see you next week when we break down the Accountants webisodes.
那么，我们下周见，届时我们将解析《会计师》网络短剧。

1480
01:09:06.760 --> 01:09:11.600
And don't forget, you can watch the webisodes on YouTube before you listen to our breakdown.
别忘了，在听我们的解析之前，你可以先在YouTube上观看这些短剧。

1481
01:09:12.020 --> 01:09:15.240
And when you put them all together, it's about 20 minutes long.
把它们连起来看，总共大约20分钟长。

1482
01:09:15.400 --> 01:09:16.840
It's kind of like an episode of The Office.
就像《办公室》的一集一样。

1483
01:09:17.180 --> 01:09:17.500
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1484
01:09:18.280 --> 01:09:21.400
We'll put a link in our stories about where you can watch it as well.
我们也会在快拍里放一个链接，告诉大家去哪里观看。

1485
01:09:21.460 --> 01:09:23.160
And we can't wait to see you next week.
我们迫不及待想在下周见到你们了。

1486
01:09:23.420 --> 01:09:25.000
Have a great rest of the week.
祝大家这周剩下的时间过得愉快。

1487
01:09:25.360 --> 01:09:25.720
Bye.
再见。

1488
01:09:25.940 --> 01:09:26.100
Bye.
再见。

1489
01:09:26.100 --> 01:09:36.050
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies.
感谢收听《办公室女士》。

